1
00:00:00,657 --> 00:00:04,787
(Howard:)Yeah, well, Bernadette's a little
under the weather and my mom's...

2
00:00:04,962 --> 00:00:07,332
(Howard:)...kind of under my dentist.

3
00:00:08,365 --> 00:00:11,195
(Raj:)Wait, your...
Your mother's sleeping with your dentist?

4
00:00:11,401 --> 00:00:15,361
(Howard:)Former dentist. I need a new one
now that I know where his hands have been.

5
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:19,400
(Raj:)So you're wandering
all around by yourself?

6
00:00:19,576 --> 00:00:22,706
That's not the hero's welcome
an astronaut should come home to.

7
00:00:22,879 --> 00:00:29,009
(Howard:)It's okay. You know, we space cowboys
don't do what we do for glory and fame.

8
00:00:29,186 --> 00:00:32,646
(Howard:)We leave that to your rock stars,
and your athletes...

9
00:00:32,823 --> 00:00:35,223
(Howard:)...and your Howie Mandels.

10
00:00:37,828 --> 00:00:40,588
(Stuart:)Oh, hey, man, welcome back.

11
00:00:40,797 --> 00:00:43,787
(Howard:)Oh, Stuart, thanks.
What are you doing here?

12
00:00:44,001 --> 00:00:47,441
(Stuart:)- I kind of live here now.
- Just until he gets back on his feet.

13
00:00:47,604 --> 00:00:51,434
(Raj:)Which are looking pretty good
in the boots I bought him for his birthday.

14
00:00:54,778 --> 00:00:59,018
(Stuart:)Ah, he's spoiling me and I love it.

